    "pros": [
      "25 g of whey isolate protein in about 110 calories, per the brand",
      "Unusually wide range of dessert flavors",
      "Single-serve packs make it easy to sample"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "About 2.65 to 2.95 dollars per 25 g of protein",
      "Sweetener and serving weight not stated in page text; no certification named",
      "Sold direct; no official Amazon listing confirmed"
    ],
