      "About 3.49 dollars per 25 g of protein",
      "Beef and collagen proteins are lower in leucine than whey"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "A reasonable dairy-free option if you want beef over plant protein and accept the price.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "25 g (brand, per stick)",
      "Calories": "About 100",
      "Third-party testing": "None named",
      "Best for": "Dairy-free buyers"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "prodough-plant-protein",
    "name": "ProDough Plant Protein",
    "brand": "ProDough",
    "badge": "Plant-Based Option",
