              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                ProDough's appeal is its flavor range, but dessert flavors are personal and a full bag costs around 60 dollars. Buy the Protein Singles or the sampler first, keep notes on which flavors you would actually drink every day, and only then commit to full bags with Subscribe and Save.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Baking with expensive flavored protein</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Flavored, sweetened protein at around 3 dollars per 25 g is a costly baking ingredient and limits what you can make. For regular baking, use a large bag of unflavored whey or isolate and add your own sweetener and flavor, keeping ProDough for shakes and oats.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Assuming transparent labels means certification</h3>
